2025-12-05 03:09:14.605 | INFO     | __main__:chat_endpoint:116 - ## Summary
Urban Escape generally charges higher cancellation fees for last-minute bookings compared to CozyInn.

## Key Findings
• Urban Escape's last-minute cancellation fees can be as high as 50% to 55% of the total booking amount, with some cases reaching up to $100 or more [1], [2], [3], [4].
• CozyInn's last-minute cancellation fees are typically lower, often around 50% to 75% of the total booking amount, but they also apply similar fees to advance bookings, which can be confusing for customers [5], [6], [7].
• Customers at both hotels express frustration with the high fees for last-minute cancellations, often comparing them unfavorably to other hotel chains like Marriott and Hilton, which are perceived to have more flexible policies [1], [5], [8].

## Analysis
The data reveals a significant difference in how Urban Escape and CozyInn handle cancellation fees for last-minute bookings. Urban Escape's fees are consistently higher, which may deter last-minute cancellations but also leads to customer dissatisfaction. CozyInn, while having lower last-minute fees, applies similar fees to advance bookings, which can lead to confusion and frustration among customers. This suggests a potential area for CozyInn to clarify their policy to improve customer satisfaction. The consistent mention of other hotel chains with more flexible policies indicates a competitive disadvantage for both Urban Escape and CozyInn.

## Recommendations
- Urban Escape should consider revising their last-minute cancellation fee structure to be more competitive and customer-friendly, potentially offering more flexibility for loyal customers.
- CozyInn should clarify their cancellation policy to ensure customers understand the fee structure, especially the application of similar fees to both last-minute and advance bookings.
- Both hotels could benefit from benchmarking their policies against competitors like Marriott and Hilton to identify areas for improvement in customer satisfaction.

