## Recommendations
- Enhance real-time communication with customers regarding delays to manage expectations and reduce frustration.
- Develop a more robust system for quickly acknowledging delays and providing updates to passengers.
- Consider expanding compensation options to include more flexible rebooking policies or additional amenities to improve customer satisfaction.

