2025-12-05 03:12:37.083 | INFO     | __main__:chat_endpoint:116 - ## Summary
Coastal Wings generally processes refunds for delayed flights faster than Delta Airlines, but customers perceive Delta as having a smoother process.

## Key Findings
• Coastal Wings claims a faster refund processing time of three to five business days compared to Delta's timeline, which can extend up to two weeks [1], [2].
• Customers frequently express confusion and dissatisfaction with Coastal Wings' refund policy, particularly regarding eligibility and the distinction between refunds and travel credits [3], [4].
• Delta Airlines is perceived by some customers as having a better reputation for customer service and a smoother refund process, despite Coastal Wings' faster processing times [5], [6].

## Analysis
The data reveals a discrepancy between Coastal Wings' actual refund processing speed and customer perceptions. While Coastal Wings processes refunds more quickly, the complexity and lack of clarity in their refund policy contribute to customer dissatisfaction. This suggests that the issue may not be the speed of processing but rather the transparency and communication of the refund process. Delta's perceived superior customer service may stem from clearer communication and more straightforward policies, even if their processing time is longer.

## Recommendations
- Improve communication and transparency regarding refund policies and eligibility criteria to reduce customer confusion and dissatisfaction.
- Consider simplifying the refund process to align customer perceptions with the actual speed of processing.
- Monitor customer feedback to identify specific areas of the refund process that require clarification or improvement.

