## Key Findings
• The data focuses on customer service issues within the hotel industry, particularly noise disturbances and dissatisfaction with service [1], [2], [3].
• Customers frequently reported noise disturbances during their stays, leading to dissatisfaction and considerations of switching to other hotel brands [2], [3], [4].
