## Analysis
The data reveals a pattern of recurring issues related to noise disturbances in hotel stays, which significantly impacts customer satisfaction and brand loyalty. Customers are considering switching to other hotel brands due to these disturbances, indicating a potential systemic issue within the hotel operations. Additionally, incorrect billing further exacerbates customer dissatisfaction, suggesting a need for improved billing accuracy and customer service responsiveness.

## Recommendations
• Consider implementing noise reduction measures in hotels to enhance guest experience.
• Improve billing processes to ensure accuracy and prevent customer dissatisfaction.
• Enhance customer service training to better address and resolve guest complaints promptly.

