- Many customers are frustrated by the absence of compensation, such as meal vouchers or hotel stays, which they expect based on experiences with other airlines like Delta and United [1], [2].
- There is a perception that Coastal Wings' compensation policies are less accommodating compared to competitors, leading some customers to reconsider their loyalty to the airline [1], [3].
