## Analysis
The data reveals a systemic issue with Coastal Wings' compensation policy for mechanical delays, which is not aligned with customer expectations. This lack of compensation, coupled with poor communication, contributes to customer dissatisfaction and may impact brand loyalty. The comparison with other airlines suggests that Coastal Wings might benefit from revisiting its compensation strategy to better meet customer expectations and improve overall service quality.

