## Analysis
The data suggests that the telecom sector is handling a larger number of customer issues than the hotel sector. This could imply that telecom services might be experiencing more frequent or complex problems that necessitate customer support intervention. Alternatively, it could reflect a more proactive approach in resolving customer issues. The disparity in resolved issues might also highlight differences in customer service strategies or the nature of the services provided by each industry.

