The data indicates a clear disparity in resolution times between double-booking and name mismatch issues at LuxStay Hotels. Double-booking errors are resolved swiftly due to the straightforward nature of canceling a duplicate reservation. In contrast, name mismatches necessitate additional verification steps, leading to longer wait times for customers. This suggests a need for process improvements in handling name mismatches to enhance customer satisfaction and reduce frustration. The recurring nature of these issues also points to potential systemic problems in the booking process that LuxStay Hotels may need to address to prevent future occurrences.

