2025-12-05 09:53:37.245 | INFO     | __main__:chat_endpoint:165 - Double-booking issues at LuxStay Hotels typically take longer to resolve, often up to 48 hours, compared to other booking errors.

- Double-booking issues are generally more time-consuming to resolve than name mismatches, with some cases taking up to 48 hours [1], [2].
- Customers express frustration over the extended resolution times, especially when compared to quicker resolutions for other types of errors [3], [4].
- Priority handling for certain customer tiers, such as Gold members, can expedite the process, although the exact time savings are not specified [5].

## Analysis
The data reveals that double-booking issues at LuxStay Hotels are a significant pain point for customers due to their longer resolution times. This suggests a potential systemic issue in the booking system that may require a more streamlined process or additional resources to handle these cases more efficiently. The frustration expressed by customers indicates a need for better communication and possibly enhanced customer service protocols to manage expectations and improve satisfaction.

