## Analysis
The data reveals a systemic issue with cleanliness at Beachfront Suites, affecting both budget and higher-tier rooms. The frequent comparison to other hotel chains like Marriott and Hilton suggests that Beachfront Suites is not meeting industry standards, leading to potential loss of customer loyalty. The recurring nature of these complaints indicates a need for a comprehensive review and improvement of housekeeping practices to align with guest expectations and industry benchmarks.

